<title>PHILIPPINES: BPI says group 1996 net at 3.992 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>BPI says group 1996 net at 3.992 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of the Philippine Islands (BPI) said on Wednesday its group net profit reached 3.992 billion pesos in 1996 following its merger with CityTrust banking Corp in October.</p>
<p>It did not give comparable figures for its proforma combined profits with CityTrust in 1995. But BPI alone made a net profit of 1.986 billion pesos in 1995.</p>
</text>
